WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: This tape runs the historical v3 contract lifecycle smoke.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
narrator: It uses a configured devnet endpoint and a funded fixture wallet.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
narrator: The script deploys main-v3 and submits Circle registration.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.000
narrator: Tailnet and session calls use the historical v3 interface.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:35.000
narrator: Claim and confirmation inputs are not proof of traffic delivery.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:58.000
narrator: The replay compares a hash chain with contract state.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:30.000
narrator: Inspect transaction checks, overclaim rejection, and anchor rotation.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:00.000
narrator: This historical smoke does not qualify the current prepaid client or a Mainnet launch.
